Place your photos in this folder with these names to load them automatically:

letter.jpg     Photo on the letter scene
memory-1.jpg   First collage photo
memory-2.jpg   Second collage photo
memory-3.jpg   Third collage photo
memory-4.jpg   Fourth collage photo
mine.jpg       Photo on the final question scene

Use JPG, PNG, or WebP. If you use a different filename or extension, update
that photo slot's data-image path in Boyfriend's Day Surprise.html.

You can also click a photo slot and choose an image from your device. That
picker preview lasts only until the page is reloaded; files in this folder
are the persistent option.
